# DRIP overview

**DRIP** (Data Retrieval & Ingestion Platform) is a VS Code extension at `vscode/extensions/drip/`.

A notes app with a **file-based knowledge base**: user selects a KB folder, writes structured `.d.txt` notes, and uses the platform to **ingest** (store) and **retrieve** (search) content across that tree.

## Canonical spec

**`@cursor/new/features.txt`** — product architecture, userflow, SQLite index design, heading IDs, UI layout (LHS / Editor / RHS), `.d.txt` format. **This is the main document.** Read relevant sections before features, planning, or structural work.

